    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        LVLMs as inspectors: an agentic framework for category-level structural defect annotation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jiang%2C+S">Sheng Jiang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ning%2C+Y">Yuanmin Ning</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Huang%2C+B">Bingxi Huang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+P">Peiyin Chen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+Z">Zhaohui Chen</a>
      
