        How Foundational are Foundation Models for Time Series Forecasting?
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Karaouli%2C+N">Nouha Karaouli</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Coquenet%2C+D">Denis Coquenet</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fromont%2C+E">Elisa Fromont</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mermillod%2C+M">Martial Mermillod</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Reyboz%2C+M">Marina Reyboz</a>
      
