    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Are Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> Models Ready to Guide Blind and Low-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span> Individuals?
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
