    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Solar PV Installation Potential Assessment on Building Facades Based on <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span> and <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> Foundation Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
